 U.S. Chapter LUG Advocate. JoAnn's term will run from November 1, 1996
 through October 31, 1997.


 JoAnn has an extensive background of working in the Chapter, ranging
from being
 active in the DFWLUG, as a SIG Campground Coordinator, member of the
Symposia
 Committee and then the D.C. Program team, and most recently as the
Project
 Manager for the Interactive Session Project and as the Austin BAT LUG
 Counterpart.

 The Board and I look forward to working with JoAnn as she continues the
effort
 to revitalize and promote the Local User Groups of the Chapter.
 
