platform we use (Alpha OVMS, DEC C), the technical support individual
admitted that we are using the *best* possible computer for our
application.  I was tolf that WinNT and SQL servers can process data @ 55
msec but the ethernet drivers are not guaranteed to  operate at these
speeds.  The ethernet drivers are guaranteed to gather data at once per
second.

