references: <54psm4$3vu@usenet.pa.dec.com> <54qqas$qoa@usenet.srv.cis.pitt.edu> <01bbc2ac$1cf125f0$8d4d6083@chewbacca> <1996Oct2623.54.28.11110@koobera.math.uic.edu>
