This is 1997s competition for high end Windows NT PCs. Other people like
AMD and Cyrix try to displace Intel by building a better Intel CPU. We
try to do it with Alphas and a translator (FX!32). It will be interesting
to see who will be able to run Intel Win32 code faster in 1997: Intel CPUs
or Alphas with FX!32 (Don't be misled by V1.0 performance).

