Over on comp.arch, someone muttered about the nattering nabobs.  Bad news
makes better press.  Like when was the last time you heard good news
about Bill Clinton?  Sorry, bad example....

Or why is the press quiet on the 21264 unveiled at the Microprocessor Forum?
