I just did it recently. There is a small switch located at the rear
between the two serial ports and the eight little LEDs. It could
not be seen from outside on my box here, I had to open it. Switching
will turn the system into a VAX-server. The console port is then the
one marked with a printer symbol (the left one of the two serial ones).

But there is one problem: you will need a different VMS license in 
order to run the system... .

