Well..here's a little help..look for a little red slide switch on the back of 
the machine..I think you will find it on thr right side looking at the rear of 
the machine. switch this to the up position and connect your terminal to port 
nearest the switch.. On power up you should see the count down and the boot 
stuff.
Note: This makes the system a Vaxserver, not a Vaxstation which affects the 
license on VMS..A Vaxstation is a activity D and a Vaxserver is a B license.
You can still login but only on the console, your terminal you just connected, 
as your current license will not work..
Good luck!



