>which sets whether or not to include the border when positioning a window.
>Sorry that I didn't look a little harder.  Now I need to just find out how
>to get this value in my program...

Just use the standard resource mechanism.  If you want to restrict it to one 
application, use:

Mwm*<appname>*positionIsFrame:	True (or False, whichever)

in your decw$mwm.dat file in decw$user_defaults: (usually = sys$login:).

If you really want to do it all in C or whatever, it's harder, but I can't 
see why you would.

