On 8 Oct 1996 21:08:23 -0400, clubchuck9@aol.com (Clubchuck9) wrote:

>I have a Starion 915 with the telecommander 2500,  I have had nothing but
>trouble with the darn thing.  I cannot get sound at all.  I need someone
