   ------- ----------      ----------      ------------    -----
   0       130             1280x1024       72              1
   1       119             1280x1024       66              1
   2       108             1280x1024       60              1
   3       104             1152x900        72              1
   4       93              1152x900        66              1
   5       75              1024x768        70              1 (default)
   6       74              1024x768        72              1
   7       69              1024x864        60              2
   8       65              1024x768        60
   9       50              800x600         72
