      actually:
	   ??              1152x900        60
   3: Niklas and his monitor experimentally determined that this was
      actually:
	   ??              1280x1024       72


   I'd trust the table except for the entry for setting 7 -- see note
   2.  I'm not sure i'd use setting 15.


