:In article <53l8fq$58d@drain.datlog.co.uk:, rwoodwar@datlog.co.uk (Roger Woodward) writes:
: Hi there,
: 
: Can anyone point me to a helpful resource that details how to set up
: and hook into shared memory under OpenVMS (via a C interface). 
: 
