>Can somebody give me some instruction on how to install NT on a DEC?

If you're talking about an Intel-based machine you simply stick in the 
first boot disk and go.  (Check your processor first though, I think MS 
has dropped support for the i386 in version 4.0)

If you're talking about Alpha based machines (NT isn't supported on 
anything but Intel, MIPS, PowerPC, and Alpha) then there should be 
an option called 'Install NT from CDROM' under 'Other Options' in 
your boot menu.  If there are not any menu choices that make sense 
you might need a firmware upgrade, call DEC.   (Do any of you 
OpenVMS folks have the 'Install NT' option in your firmware boot menu?)

Hope this helps,
anthony




