Gregory Neil Shapiro wrote:
> 
> craig> 1) Does anyone know why this wouldn't work?  I know I'm probably not
> craig> providing enough info, but does anyone have any suggestions?
> craig> 2) Why, if I know the filter is not sending anything through, does
> craig> output still get sent to the printer?
